New keybind action app.reloadAll (default mod+r): recycle the Desktop-owned backend for the profile in view (remote gateways just reconnect), then reload the window, so core/plugin edits land without quitting the app. session.resume moves from ⌘R to ⌥⌘R. ⇧⌘R stays the plain window reload.
